{"title": "Githborn Psionic Weapon (1d6)", "pageid": 34866, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Githborn_Psionic_Weapon_(1d6)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See <a href=\"/wiki/Githborn_Psionic_Weapon\" title=\"Githborn Psionic Weapon\">Githborn Psionic Weapon</a> for the 1d4 version.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Githborn Psionic Weapon</b> is a passive feature granted by certain Githyanki weapons when wielded by a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When wielded by a <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">githyanki</a> this weapon deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Sword_of_the_Astral_Plane\" title=\"Silver Sword of the Astral Plane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Githyanki_Greatsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Sword_of_the_Astral_Plane\" title=\"Silver Sword of the Astral Plane\">Silver Sword of the Astral Plane</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Voss\" title=\"Voss\">Voss</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201950\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1132/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10193/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3055/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754781/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion